      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0581a1170e98882d9e93e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好──！我不会输哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aca32d36b42ccb8e306041f7fac734cf286bd8205bcb0e23b044fd97d0582ebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b1a3d80164974482c532a38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还能继续！\r\n用尽全力去碰撞吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7167f3105b248dae262a878102237fb6b8d1f6f56a68d3e1cbc1097238936273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf0e5edcf1c4055c3fedc6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊──训练员！！\r\n今天也要整天充满活力！然后……\r\n呃……充满活力地努力！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58294741906b00a89593ce3578f29c95ce28b6bdac7a1b5003d71c3b244ee45f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39988aa632db4ec9a1732288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚看到大鸟带着小鸟在飞……\r\n呜……大家一早就很努力地\r\n活着呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2a9fe1b2759e55eb236d2b6f2f1d6f6383351b5440e09ec37d8d3e25511ed3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e40464a4bac5795a9ae49795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜喔喔喔！呜喔喔喔喔────！\r\n我绝对不会输给\r\n吃完午餐的睡意的──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e51c22729b8e90cbb5c891e19605482f7323d77727b7cc4af258a9b6ffdcef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e253adcc530b5dcaa3994d8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安，训练员！\r\n现在是午后训练的时间了吧！\r\n太好啦──！我等好久了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b79c2706a14b36e6528e09d86c722f8fe6f36c245681cb4a9563359ee76b2ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6205794d7b30b9635b2883b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……又忙到这么晚，\r\n训练员真是努力呢……\r\n谢谢你为了我这么辛苦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dacfdfe4c4e57c58b3219b9505cf8a3b40eef455a7691c0fa5911dd8462a270",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:980ca8bd3dc02c9081c3a469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么──！？已经晚上了──！？\r\n我完全还没有跑够哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b346f9aa5a153685e80d30802739d2d711958a986b886ccb14b709e64599f68e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e42bd066d5863e2afda685cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盛开的樱花、相遇与离别……！\r\n春天就是这样充满感伤与感动，\r\n……我好喜欢啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33be870db892a1f6e79db2906281193884e783804e423c712d05c51603bdab43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bc4ae207e41cc1624dd43f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很热吗？那我们去游泳池吧！\r\n前空翻跳进水里超舒服的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8ede03649c4ffd5d9b8982402300207f160ef58cc12453078867249aea9472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b320b29a34f2b308f2affb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……落叶真的很了不起……\r\n直到生命的最后都那么美丽，\r\n……我也要努力地活着啊～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ae516a65336542672a4677fb5228fe7983dcc06988463a07169406914e5d4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d1665f1b85ac334cfd2bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和小雪约好要一起做雪屋哦！\r\n等做好了要约朋友们来呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fda3c9eed97e54d808c16b76caac45c894ff559c79776de4efb879bbb776a444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935254b95d8c13fed84fafd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早、安、啊────！！\r\n耶嘿，看你满脸睡意，\r\n所以来为你提振精神啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "304c0ff34501c8babc22c077c67f7479db841819b5ee527edaca7c9fa6ea0094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b7ae76a20078e471375f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你明明这么努力工作……\r\n我却总是忍不住出手打你……\r\n闹钟，真是对不起啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1513feb7d0cd7e3adb7c9dd947a87fbddc787b43dc5bb505448474c8358a318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce80ffe29ca648916202a087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在游戏中担任送货员时\r\n有帮忙送过午餐喔！\r\n下次来试试看外送打工好了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26a3446b9580f1f45df8369cc1f4f83aef04e7f8a8bff003b2086e6f24bb795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb37d6ff6d0b58634a40ff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很无聊？那一起来跑酷吧！\r\n别担心，只要灵活扭动身体\r\n就行了，很简单的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6143ca8d9770496f61811cfa4298b49f380e3ba6f5a575efa5a6aca50abaa604",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a252824dde81e815a5db030a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呜……我把作业本忘在教室了……\r\n呜哇啊啊啊啊！有没有人能\r\n把作业本送来给我啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d6167d9dfad86566f60f657b475119747f4f7af287e728a61a2b113c5d00bac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54d7b628113d509a30aa21a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听晨光说最好避免在晚上写信，\r\n就试着在晚上写写看……结果写出\r\nBNW是三色面包……天啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "471a6dd80a9af26b99969b59e4e3e0fc255b15273f4ddcb440934a59707e2c7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d87963ae0b723c132cdabb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到春天就想到开学典礼！！\r\n新生们眼中都闪闪发光！\r\n充满了梦想，真是可爱呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373ee48cc195dc907d191810d5ab70c40dfca821a3e747505ea0a6c015790624",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea21d8786c032a1e8f7cdffc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊～！真想去凉爽的地方……\r\n对了！用VR赛马娘仿真器\r\n上雪山好了！也约小雪一起去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54199b3a60baf7270bf15981de86ec71bed98a682972481c7b64cd771eea9e81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:530572ca1fb1292cd1d457f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟大进聊起想去捡栗子！\r\n然后她就告诉我一款\r\n收集栗子的益智游戏～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9147913739b8d7746d435bff364a5693772a33aa697df0e864cd24d89b6d8dfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9c080934a225ca0134a29e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上次我去滑雪时成功使出超帅气的\r\n空中特技！多亏我事前用\r\nVR赛马娘仿真器好好练习过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c69f7b48ee6b10f925cc066c5c74c68a89a8df8b5eb38611ecedc1c832261831",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62bd5f296f3eddd11297fe8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a8485ab44b16beccfc2e373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e3409843f64b13605b70e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝だよ！起きて！おっはよーー！！\r\n…どう？今度出す目覚ましボイス！\r\n声が通るからって頼まれたんだ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e17c6b087af5284de1c3791e77609a8c0386dcdba54383860cdd48d0c759961",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d602f547a287867b00ad4d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どれーなーざん、やっどぎだぁ～！\r\n夢みだいにっ、ごないどおも…！\r\nひっぐ！ずっど一緒にいでねぇぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66db8d4ab34b41e8a89a395e70ccb982bece3a76824ba33ab7a37a4084ee188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75847d815294d8eaa5090e0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウイニングチケットが\r\nお昼を宣誓しまぁぁぁぁぁす！\r\n…あれ？宣言だっけ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ad466a9a7b7ec61f2047ab3a907218a80b2aea30bf39eb19a4ce3f5c45b1868",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41693204ecd45843aedd50b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午後もビシッ！とがんばろー！\r\n…あ！お腹鳴っちゃった！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c48c895d7ea7db7f21d6e3e32ede514ef7120b41fdd63234e23e844cf65476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1143df2db02eaede96f1e95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、無理しないでね！\r\n高パフォーマンスには22時就寝！\r\nって、エルフィーさん言ってたよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "589ee0bc59889d9be76d4333f67856b06536ce2bb64bd929dda4db7965a3fe9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a9d5a62bfc9e0624f8621c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あっ！起きちゃったーー！！\r\nぬーん。ドラマみたいに上着、\r\nそっとかけようと思ったのに～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "951b7c867437a70468b54efe134d78f18085111cc299c9f195c9594ec555057c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05df8e0b4c145db0579f15d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ、毛虫！\r\n…ハヤヒデがビックリする前に、\r\nどこかへ逃がしに行こーっと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dd43c65a56312cd80b9e5efc693f63ba819aa0992798cb8faf8b35b39737df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829ccf08a14c16e4548545be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏！到！来！だー！\r\nトレーナーさん！マリンスポーツ！\r\nマリンスポーツしよー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69dfe847df6e1be0d0c5d9f5d3033974625c6d55af3d8bbfbac709417bbc49d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62370024452f7673eccbf1fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねえねえ！次の聖蹄祭でさ、\r\n一緒にマジックショーしよっ！\r\n一緒に耳、おっきくしよーー！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "803ed1d1ac00929fc8d38a5884f0e745aed36d93359c88f0bc715b93b90a0716",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dee6728e6c1d2f595ec992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、寒くない？\r\nアタシの手袋、片っぽあげるよ！\r\n大きさ合うかな～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a1d0bb84ce2da2c56ed8b7101a9c7af106d10a91ba59beca7a96b4fa7287e0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22149880839a37112173d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df843bc0f1637c991a9861df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把我的点心分给你──！\r\n应该是放在口袋里没错……\r\n奇怪？怎么会？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bd29b4911581a9a2e820c9daace3b8216025bb781653ec2d09c650017bc7f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb422f50d8f1a5ff9f0b734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次补考都会找晨光教我学习，\r\n但她还是每次都很有耐心、\r\n很严格地教我……真的人好好喔喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17d7a62de9e3e03475962389cc68bb43e75dbb89b93ae704c8b852ef6fd07d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9468f98f2274bad7c77acdbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被拜托当比赛的救援时，\r\n就会比平常更有干劲哦！\r\n因为想要达到大家的期望嘛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cc9dc3d7447fc55efbdddba1b8751353846e8cb4fdf7fb971785af41e5fcfb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "91002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
